  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be useful to have the Player Capsule adjust to outline the avatar you use rather than just form an actual capsule shape, so that player collision could be a thing by itself. Making it possible to have players able to have contact with other players they choose.\n\nI feel like this would help users with phantom pain not have to deal with people going through them, if player collision was a thing, letting friends body block against bullies, and prevent issues of people feeling stabbed/the wind knocked out of them, by being ran through.\n\nThis would also allow friends and partners to properly hug or snuggle with each other instead of worrying about sitting inside the legs of their buddy, or their friend accidently swinging their hand through their face when they wanna itch their nose.\n\nIts really more a quality of life update for people with phantom sense, pain or not, but I feel would be very helpful regardless.",
